+    ) -> list[StreamEvent]:
+        """Metadata events that bring streamed reasoning parts in line with
+        the final payload.
+
+        OpenAI encrypts reasoning per event, so the ciphertext on
+        ``output_item.done`` can differ from the one in ``response.completed``.
+        Each refresh event is merged into the part its done event opened.
+        """
